    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Operation HOPE is a top-down tower defense game with comic-style visuals and a ridiculous amount of zombies.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plan your defense carefully</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because once the horde hits, there\u2019s no time to think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475430/extras/9724b60166290ea59318a359332a96de.poster.avif?t=1749484629\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475430/extras/9724b60166290ea59318a359332a96de.webm?t=1749484629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475430/extras/9724b60166290ea59318a359332a96de.mp4?t=1749484629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face endless waves of mutated zombies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From tank-like giants to swarmers that bite your ankles off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475430/extras/c892a83cd7d71d9892d9142715dc352c.poster.avif?t=1749484629\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475430/extras/c892a83cd7d71d9892d9142715dc352c.webm?t=1749484629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475430/extras/c892a83cd7d71d9892d9142715dc352c.mp4?t=1749484629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build turrets, trigger traps, and survive the chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t chess. It\u2019s comic-book carnage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475430/extras/8aef633777e95e397fbb62f727250186.poster.avif?t=1749484629\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475430/extras/8aef633777e95e397fbb62f727250186.webm?t=1749484629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475430/extras/8aef633777e95e397fbb62f727250186.mp4?t=1749484629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stylized visuals straight out of a war-torn comic book</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful, chaotic battlefield \u2014 drawn with attitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475430/extras/b18e2557d27a23568eb815ac21dcdbcc.poster.avif?t=1749484629\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475430/extras/b18e2557d27a23568eb815ac21dcdbcc.webm?t=1749484629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475430/extras/b18e2557d27a23568eb815ac21dcdbcc.mp4?t=1749484629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play your way</strong>\u00a0 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story mode or endless rogue-like chaos.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Operation HOPE is a top-down tower defense game with comic-style visuals and a ridiculous amount of zombies.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plan your defense carefully</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because once the horde hits, there\u2019s no time to think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475430/extras/9724b60166290ea59318a359332a96de.poster.avif?t=1749484629\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475430/extras/9724b60166290ea59318a359332a96de.webm?t=1749484629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475430/extras/9724b60166290ea59318a359332a96de.mp4?t=1749484629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face endless waves of mutated zombies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From tank-like giants to swarmers that bite your ankles off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475430/extras/c892a83cd7d71d9892d9142715dc352c.poster.avif?t=1749484629\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475430/extras/c892a83cd7d71d9892d9142715dc352c.webm?t=1749484629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475430/extras/c892a83cd7d71d9892d9142715dc352c.mp4?t=1749484629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build turrets, trigger traps, and survive the chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t chess. It\u2019s comic-book carnage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475430/extras/8aef633777e95e397fbb62f727250186.poster.avif?t=1749484629\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475430/extras/8aef633777e95e397fbb62f727250186.webm?t=1749484629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475430/extras/8aef633777e95e397fbb62f727250186.mp4?t=1749484629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stylized visuals straight out of a war-torn comic book</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful, chaotic battlefield \u2014 drawn with attitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475430/extras/b18e2557d27a23568eb815ac21dcdbcc.poster.avif?t=1749484629\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475430/extras/b18e2557d27a23568eb815ac21dcdbcc.webm?t=1749484629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475430/extras/b18e2557d27a23568eb815ac21dcdbcc.mp4?t=1749484629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play your way</strong>\u00a0 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story mode or endless rogue-like chaos.</p>",
